{"id": 8905189621958, "title": "Momcozy Breast Pump M5 Smart + 120 Breastmilk Storage Bags", "body_html": "<article data-identifier-application__slash__x-doc-key=\"KM7qeobmvRLe7lpj\" data-identifier-application__slash__x-cangjie-fragment=\"\" data-clipboard-cangjie='[\"root\",{},[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1hpju6emjxhsf\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Gentle, Breast-Friendly Pumping\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1ibb3fnvaj9fb\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Baby mouth-like suction rhythm, skin-friendly silicone, and 30-minute auto stop help make daily pumping feel gentler and more comfortable.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1imt8kmc420bq\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Patented DoubleFit™ Flange for a Better Fit\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1ijtc71zditkl\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"The exclusive DoubleFit™ flange is made to fit more securely and comfortably, helping reduce slips and tugs while boosting pumping efficiency by 28.2% based on internal user feedback.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1icrvbzr6ikk\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Ultra-Light, Hands-Free Freedom\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1i0fq01e6ztjm\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Weighing only 8 oz, M5 Smart fits comfortably in your bra for cord-free, hands-free pumping—so you can move, work, care for baby, or get more done while you pump.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1jp501fcuvpo\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Personalized Pumping with Flexible Suction\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1jpbhvtlryi9\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"With 3 pumping modes and 9 suction levels, M5 Smart lets you adjust each session to your body’s needs, supporting comfortable and efficient milk expression.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1jdq09buj3bc\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Only 4 Parts to Clean\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1j7w285s3k8t5\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Made with BPA-free, food-grade silicone and PP, M5 Smart keeps cleanup simple with only 4 washable parts. Parts can be sterilized in 3 minutes and are heat safe up to 212°F.\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1j3uohkkf3n2w\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"bold\":true,\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Easier Control from Your Phone\"]]],[\"p\",{\"uuid\":\"mokwft1k9qbk5boaybo\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"text\"},[\"span\",{\"data-type\":\"leaf\"},\"Use the Momcozy app to adjust modes and suction levels, track milk output, and view visual pumping stats by day, week, or month—giving you easier control without reaching into your bra.\"]]]]' class=\"4ever-article\">\n<p><strong><span data-type=\"text\">Gentle, Breast-Friendly Pumping</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-type=\"text\">Baby mouth-like suction rhythm, skin-friendly silicone, and 30-minute auto stop help make daily pumping feel gentler and more comfortable.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-type=\"text\">Patented DoubleFit™ Flange for a Better Fit</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-type=\"text\">The exclusive DoubleFit™ flange is made to fit more securely and comfortably, helping reduce slips and tugs while boosting pumping efficiency by 28.2% based on internal user feedback.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-type=\"text\">Ultra-Light, Hands-Free Freedom</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-type=\"text\">Weighing only 8 oz, M5 Smart fits comfortably in your bra for cord-free, hands-free pumping—so you can move, work, care for baby, or get more done while you pump.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-type=\"text\">Personalized Pumping with Flexible Suction</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-type=\"text\">With 3 pumping modes and 9 suction levels, M5 Smart lets you adjust each session to your body’s needs, supporting comfortable and efficient milk expression.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-type=\"text\">Only 4 Parts to Clean</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-type=\"text\">Made with BPA-free, food-grade silicone and PP, M5 Smart keeps cleanup simple with only 4 washable parts. Parts can be sterilized in 3 minutes and are heat safe up to 212°F.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-type=\"text\">Easier Control from Your Phone</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-type=\"text\">Use the Momcozy app to adjust modes and suction levels, track milk output, and view visual pumping stats by day, week, or month—giving you easier control without reaching into your bra.</span></p>\n</article>", "vendor": "Momcozy", "product_type": "Breast Pump", "created_at": "2026-06-03T08:43:25-04:00", "handle": "m5-smart-wearable-breast-pump-breastmilk-storage-bags-bundle", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:04-04:00", "published_at": "2026-06-04T01:12:58-04:00", "template_suffix": "product-m5-smart", "published_scope": "global", "tags": "bundle, 主机+奶袋, 吸奶器, 吸奶器Bundles", "variants": [{"id": 45910807445702, "product_id": 8905189621958, "title": "Cozy Red + 120 count bags", "price": "219.99", "sku": "BP080-MR-YB10-NEW", "position": 1, "compare_at_price": "219.99", "fulfillment_service": "manual", "inventory_management": null, "option1": "Cozy Red + 120 count bags", "option2": null, "option3": null, "created_at": "2026-06-03T08:53:37-04:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-13T03:55:04-04:00", "taxable": true, "barcode": "162383694914", "grams": 500, "image_id": 41745446240454, "weight": 0.5, "weight_unit": "kg", "tax_code": "", "requires_shipping": true, "quantity_rule": {"min": 1, "max": null, "increment": 1}, "price_currency": "USD", "compare_at_price_currency": "USD", "quantity_price_breaks": []}, {"id": 45910777528518, "product_id": 8905189621958, "title": "Quill Grey + 1